<title>USA: Manor Care stake raised by Baron to 12.7pc.</title>
<headline>Manor Care stake raised by Baron to 12.7pc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group controlled by New York investor Ronald Baron said Monday it has increased its stake in Manor Care Inc to 12.7 percent or 7,976,459 shares from a last reported 11.4 percent or 7,152,784 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Baron said his group acquired the additional shares of the Maryland-based operator of nursing homes between April 30 and June 16 at $23.11 to $31.31 each.</p>
